cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "mcp-fdsnws-event: FDSNWS Event MCP Server"
abstract: >-
  An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that wraps the FDSN Web Service Event
  APIs of multiple seismological datacenters (INGV, EMSC, GFZ, USGS, and other
  FDSN-compliant services) and provides earthquake data as JSON to MCP clients.
